# Only what the image copies goes in the build context: backend/, buddy/, core/, skills/ and
# requirements-runtime.lock (see the Dockerfile). Everything else stays out, and above all
# anything that could hold a secret or a user's file.
*

!requirements-runtime.lock
!backend/
!buddy/
!core/
!skills/

# Inside the copied folders
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/openapi.json
